" all PAO-based local correlation methods can be prepended by ``DF-`` to "
"invoke density fitting (PNO always implies density fitting)."
msgstr ""
"``HF``\\ 、\\ ``KS``\\ 、\\ ``UHF``\\ 、\\ ``UKS``\\ 、\\ ``MP2``\\ 、\\ "
"``CCSD``\\ 、\\ ``MCSCF``\\ 、\\ ``RS2`` 以及所有基于投影原子轨道的局域相关方法都可以通过前缀 ``DF-`` "
"来调用密度拟合（PNO 总是意味着密度拟合）。"

msgid ""
"``HF``, ``KS``, ``UHF``, ``UKS`` can be pretended by ``LDF-`` to invoke "
"local density fitting approximations."
msgstr "``HF``\\ 、\\ ``KS``\\ 、\\ ``UHF``\\ 、\\ ``UKS`` 可以通过前缀 ``LDF-`` 来调用局域密度拟合近似。"

