msgstr "Molpro 帮助"

msgid ""
"The help command can be used to obtain a short description of commands, "
"input parameters, and variables. The syntax is:"
msgstr "帮助命令可用于获取命令、输入参数和变量的简短描述。语法为："

msgid ""
"where *set* is either ``COMMAND``, ``VARIABLE``, or the name of the input "
"set (e.g., ``THRESH``, ``PRINT``, ``LOCAL``, ``EOM``, ``CFIT``), and *name* "
"is the name of the parameter. If *name* is blank, all parameters of the set "
"are shown. Optionally, *keys* can be specified to request specific "
"information (e.g., ``short_description``, ``long_description``, "
"``default_value``, ``type``, ``program``). If *keys* are not given, "
"``short_description`` is assumed."
msgstr ""
"其中 *set* 是 ``COMMAND``\\ 、\\ ``VARIABLE`` 或输入集的名称（例如 ``THRESH``\\ 、\\ "
"``PRINT``\\ 、\\ ``LOCAL``\\ 、\\ ``EOM``\\ 、\\ ``CFIT``\\ ），而 *name* "
"是参数的名称。如果 *name* 为空，则显示该集合的所有参数。可选地，可以指定 *keys* 来请求特定信息（例如 "
"``short_description``\\ 、\\ ``long_description``\\ 、\\ ``default_value``\\ "
"、\\ ``type``\\ 、\\ ``program``\\ ）。如果未给出 *keys*\\ ，则默认为 "
"``short_description``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Currently, help is only available for a limited number of parameters and "
"commands. However, the database will be extended in the near future."
msgstr "目前，帮助功能仅适用于有限数量的参数和命令。不过，该数据库将在不久的将来得到扩展。"

msgid ""
"If the memory card is given, it should be the first card (after the optional"
" title card). If any file cards are given, they should follow immediately. "
"The order of ``basis``, ``geometry``, ``gprint``, ``gdirect``, ``gthresh``, "
"``gexpec``, and variable definitions is arbitrary. It is possible to call "
"several programs one after each other. It is also possible to redefine basis"
" set and/or geometry between the call to programs; the program will "
"recognize automatically if the integrals have to be recomputed."
msgstr ""
"如果给出了内存卡，它应当是（可选标题卡之后的）第一张卡。如果给出了任何文件卡，它们应当紧随其后。\\ ``basis``\\ 、\\ "
"``geometry``\\ 、\\ ``gprint``\\ 、\\ ``gdirect``\\ 、\\ ``gthresh``\\ 、\\ "
"``gexpec`` "
"以及变量定义的顺序是任意的。可以依次调用多个程序。也可以在程序调用之间重新定义基组和/或几何结构；程序将自动识别是否需要重新计算积分。"

