msgstr "*(5421)*"

msgid ""
"The orbital spaces may also be defined outside command blocks, and then the "
"directive is treated as global, i.e., it is used in all subsequent programs."
" Spaces specific to certain wavefunction types can be defined by specifying "
"the program name with a ``CONTEXT`` option, e.g.,"
msgstr ""
"轨道空间也可以在命令块之外定义，此时该指令被视为全局的，即在所有后续程序中使用。可以通过在 ``CONTEXT`` "
"选项中指定程序名来定义特定于某些波函数类型的空间，例如"

msgid ""
"``ORBITAL[,[RECORD=]record] [,[TYPE=]orbtype] [,STATE=state] "
"[,SYM[METRY]=symmetry]]``"
msgstr ""
"``ORBITAL[,[RECORD=]record] [,[TYPE=]orbtype] [,STATE=state] "
"[,SYM[METRY]=symmetry]]``"

msgid ""
"``DENSITY[,[RECORD=]record] [,[TYPE=]dentype] [,STATE[B]=stateb] "
"[,SYM[B]=symb] [,SPIN[B]=spinb] [,MS2[B]=ms2b] [,STATEK=statek] [,SYMK=symk]"
" [,SPINK=spink] [,MS2K=ms2k] [,[N]ELEC=nelec] [,SET=iset]``"
msgstr ""
"``DENSITY[,[RECORD=]record] [,[TYPE=]dentype] [,STATE[B]=stateb] "
"[,SYM[B]=symb] [,SPIN[B]=spinb] [,MS2[B]=ms2b] [,STATEK=statek] [,SYMK=symk]"
" [,SPINK=spink] [,MS2K=ms2k] [,[N]ELEC=nelec] [,SET=iset]``"

msgid ""
"where the (optional) specifications can be used to select specific orbitals "
"or densities, if several different orbital sets are stored in the same "
"record. If a specification is not given, it is not checked and the last "
"written set that fulfills all other criteria is used. The meaning of the "
"individual specifications are as follows:"
msgstr ""
"其中（可选的）各项设定可用于在同一个记录中存储了多个不同轨道集时选择特定的轨道或密度。如果未给出某项设定，则不对该项进行检查，并使用满足所有其他条件的最后写入的集合。各项设定的含义如下："

msgid "***orbtype*** Orbital type. This can be one of"
msgstr "***orbtype*** 轨道类型。可以是以下之一："

msgid ""
"``CANONICAL``: canonical or pseudo-canonical orbitals; ``NATURAL: natural "
"orbitals;\\\\`` ``LOCAL: localized orbitals;\\\\`` ``LOCAL(PM): localized "
"Pipek-Mezey orbitals;\\\\`` ``LOCAL(BOYS): localized Boys orbitals;\\\\`` "
"``PROJECTED``: projected virtual orbitals used in local calculations. "
"Without further specification, the most recently computed orbitals of the "
"specified type are used. If the orbital type is not specified, the program "
"will try to find the most suitable orbitals automatically. For instance, in "
"MRCI calculations ``NATURAL`` orbitals will be used preferentially if "
"available; MRPT (CASPT2) calculations will first search for ``CANONICAL`` "
"orbitals, and local calculations will first look for ``LOCAL`` orbitals. "
"Therefore, in most cases the orbital type needs not to be specified."
msgstr ""
"``CANONICAL``\\ ：正则或准正则轨道；\\ ``NATURAL: 自然轨道；\\\\`` ``LOCAL: 定域轨道；\\\\`` "
"``LOCAL(PM): 定域 Pipek-Mezey 轨道；\\\\`` ``LOCAL(BOYS): 定域 Boys 轨道；\\\\`` "
"``PROJECTED``\\ "
"：局部计算中使用的投影虚轨道。若未进一步指定，则使用最近计算的指定类型的轨道。如果未指定轨道类型，程序将尝试自动寻找最合适的轨道。例如，在 MRCI "
"计算中，如果可用，将优先使用 ``NATURAL`` 轨道；MRPT (CASPT2) 计算将首先搜索 ``CANONICAL`` "
"轨道，而局部计算将首先寻找 ``LOCAL`` 轨道。因此，在大多数情况下无需指定轨道类型。"

msgid ""
"***state*** Specifies a particular state in the form :math:`istate.isym`. "
"For instance, 2.1 refers to the second state in symmetry 1. This can be used"
" if density matrices or natural orbitals have been computed for different "
"states in a state-averaged CASSCF calculation. If not given, the last "
"written orbitals are used. A state-averaged density can be selected using "
"``STATE=AV[ERAGED]``. The specification of :math:`isym` is optional; it can "
"also be defined using the ``SYMMETRY`` key."
msgstr ""
"***state*** 以 :math:`istate.isym` 的形式指定特定状态。例如，2.1 指的是对称性 1 中的第二个态。当在态平均 "
"CASSCF 计算中为不同状态计算了密度矩阵或自然轨道时，可以使用此选项。如果未给出，则使用最后写入的轨道。可以使用 "
"``STATE=AV[ERAGED]`` 选择态平均密度。\\ :math:`isym` 的指定是可选的；也可以使用 ``SYMMETRY`` "
"关键字来定义。"

msgid "***dentype*** Density type. This can be one of"
msgstr "***dentype*** 密度类型。可以是以下之一："

msgid ""
"``CHARGE: charge density;\\\\`` ``SPIN: UHF spin density;\\\\`` "
"``TRANSITION: transition density matrix;\\\\`` The default is ``CHARGE``."
msgstr ""
"``CHARGE: 电荷密度；\\\\`` ``SPIN: UHF 自旋密度；\\\\`` ``TRANSITION: 跃迁密度矩阵；\\\\`` "
"默认为 ``CHARGE``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"***symmetry*** Specifies a particular state symmetry. Alternatively, the "
"state symmetry can be specified using ``STATE`` (see above)."
msgstr "***symmetry*** 指定特定的态对称性。或者，也可以使用 ``STATE``\\ （见上文）来指定态对称性。"

msgid ""
"***spin*** Spin quantum number, i.e. 0 for singlet, 1/2 for doublet, 1 for "
"triplet, etc. Alternatively ``MS2`` can be used."
msgstr "***spin*** 自旋量子数，即 0 代表单重态，1/2 代表双重态，1 代表三重态，等等。也可以使用 ``MS2``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"***ms2*** :math:`2 M_S`, i.e. 0 for singlet, 1 for doublet, 2 for triplet "
"etc. Alternatively, ``SPIN`` can be used."
msgstr ""
"***ms2*** :math:`2 M_S`\\ ，即 0 代表单重态，1 代表双重态，2 代表三重态，等等。也可以使用 ``SPIN``\\ 。"

msgid "***nelec*** Number of electrons."
msgstr "***nelec*** 电子数。"

msgid ""
"***iset*** Set number of orbitals. The orbital sets are numbered in the "
"order they are stored."
msgstr "***iset*** 轨道集编号。轨道集按其存储顺序编号。"

msgid ""
"In some cases (e.g. in ``MATROP``) transition density matrices can be "
"specified. In this case ``STATEB``, ``SYMB``, ``MS2B``, ``SPINB`` refer to "
"the bra state and ``STATEK``, ``SYMK``, ``MS2K``, ``SPINK`` refer to the ket"
" state. If bra and ket differ, ``TYPE=TRANSITION`` is implied, and "
"``SYMMETRY`` is automatically set to the product symmetry of bra and ket. If"
" ``STATEK``, ``SYMK``, ``MS2K``, ``SPINK`` are not given, they are assumed "
"to be equal to the corresponding bra quantities. See section :doc:`matrix "
"operations <matrix_operations>` for examples."
msgstr ""
"在某些情况下（例如在 ``MATROP`` 中）可以指定跃迁密度矩阵。此时 ``STATEB``\\ 、\\ ``SYMB``\\ 、\\ "
"``MS2B``\\ 、\\ ``SPINB`` 指的是左矢（bra）态，而 ``STATEK``\\ 、\\ ``SYMK``\\ 、\\ "
"``MS2K``\\ 、\\ ``SPINK`` 指的是右矢（ket）态。如果左矢和右矢不同，则隐含 ``TYPE=TRANSITION``\\ ，且 "
"``SYMMETRY`` 自动设为左矢和右矢的乘积对称性。如果未给出 ``STATEK``\\ 、\\ ``SYMK``\\ 、\\ "
"``MS2K``\\ 、\\ ``SPINK``\\ ，则假定它们等于相应的左矢量。示例见章节 :doc:`矩阵操作 "
"<matrix_operations>`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"If ``NOCHECK`` is specified, some consistency checks for finding correct "
"orbitals are skipped, and error messages like \"ORBITALS CORRESPOND TO "
"DIFFERENT GEOMETRY\" are ignored."
msgstr ""
"如果指定了 ``NOCHECK``\\ ，则会跳过一些用于寻找正确轨道的一致性检查，并忽略诸如 \"ORBITALS CORRESPOND TO "
"DIFFERENT GEOMETRY\" 之类的错误消息。"

msgid "``PLUGIN,COMMAND=command,PROCS=procs``"
msgstr "``PLUGIN,COMMAND=command,PROCS=procs``"

msgid "***Program control:***"
msgstr "***程序控制：***"

msgid "**``PRINT``,\\ ``GPRINT``** controls global print levels"
msgstr "**``PRINT``,\\ ``GPRINT``** 控制全局打印级别"

msgid "**``THRESH``,\\ ``GTHRESH``** controls global thresholds"
msgstr "**``THRESH``,\\ ``GTHRESH``** 控制全局阈值"

msgid ""
"**``DIRECT``,\\ ``GDIRECT``** flags direct computation of integrals and for "
"setting direct options"
msgstr "**``DIRECT``,\\ ``GDIRECT``** 标记直接计算积分及设置直接选项"

msgid "**``EXPEC``,\\ ``GEXPEC``** controls computation of expectation values"
msgstr "**``EXPEC``,\\ ``GEXPEC``** 控制期望值的计算"

msgid "``ENDIF`` end of ``IF block``"
msgstr "``ENDIF`` ``IF block`` 的结束"

msgid "**``DELETE``, ``ERASE``** data set deletion"
msgstr "**``DELETE``, ``ERASE``** 数据集删除"

msgid "***Variables:***"
msgstr "***变量：***"

msgid "***Wave function optimization:***"
msgstr "***波函数优化：***"

msgid ""
"**``HF`` or ``RHF``** calls spin-restricted Hartree-Fock program (open or "
"closed shell)"
msgstr "**``HF`` 或 ``RHF``** 调用自旋限制 Hartree-Fock 程序（开壳层或闭壳层）"

msgid ""
"**``KS``, ``RKS``** call the Kohn-Sham spin restricted density functional "
"program"
msgstr "**``KS``, ``RKS``** 调用 Kohn-Sham 自旋限制密度泛函程序"

msgid "**``MULTI``, ``MCSCF``, or ``CASSCF``** calls MCSCF/CASSCF program"
msgstr "**``MULTI``, ``MCSCF`` 或 ``CASSCF``** 调用 MCSCF/CASSCF 程序"

msgid ""
"**``CI``, ``MRCI``, or ``CI-PRO``** calls internally contracted MRCI program"
" (only pairs contracted)"
msgstr "**``CI``, ``MRCI`` 或 ``CI-PRO``** 调用内收缩 MRCI 程序（仅收缩对）"

msgid ""
"**``CIC`` or ``MRCIC``** calls the faster internally contracted MRCI program"
" (pairs and singles contracted)"
msgstr "**``CIC`` 或 ``MRCIC``** 调用更快的内收缩 MRCI 程序（收缩对和单激发）"

msgid "**``ACPF``, ``AQCC``** calls internally contracted MR-ACPF program"
msgstr "**``ACPF``, ``AQCC``** 调用内收缩 MR-ACPF 程序"

msgid ""
"**``RS2``, ``RS3``** calls internally contracted multireference perturbation"
" theory program (only pairs contracted)"
msgstr "**``RS2``, ``RS3``** 调用内收缩多参考微扰理论程序（仅收缩对）"

msgid ""
"**``CASPT2`` or ``RS2C``** calls faster program for internally contracted "
"multireference perturbation theory"
msgstr "**``CASPT2`` 或 ``RS2C``** 调用用于内收缩多参考微扰理论的更快程序"

msgid "``DCSD`` calls closed-shell distingusihable cluster program"
msgstr "``DCSD`` 调用闭壳层可区分簇程序"

msgid ""
"**``QCI``,\\ ``QCSID``** calls closed-shell quadratic configuration "
"interaction program"
msgstr "**``QCI``,\\ ``QCSID``** 调用闭壳层二次组态相互作用程序"

msgid "**``FCI`` or ``FULLCI``** calls determinant based full CI program"
msgstr "**``FCI`` 或 ``FULLCI``** 调用基于行列式的全 CI 程序"

msgid "***Local correlation methods:***"
msgstr "***局域相关方法：***"

msgid "***Explicitly correlated methods:***"
msgstr "***显式相关方法：***"

msgid "***Orbital manipulation:***"
msgstr "***轨道操作：***"

msgid "***Properties and wavefunction analysis:***"
msgstr "***性质和波函数分析：***"

